error[L0512]: cannot pass a borrow of a local value to `whole`
 --> run/closure_whole_parameter_borrow_result.rslisp:8:26
  |
6 |   (let leaf (->car :make "Nissan" :year 2025))
  |        ---- this local is dropped when the function returns
7 |   (let whole (fn ((leaf (ref car))) leaf))
  |                   ---------------- `whole` ties this parameter to its result, so it needs a borrow that outlives the function
8 |   (println (:year (whole (ref leaf)))))
  |                          ^^^^^^^^^^ this borrows a local value
  |
  = help: define `whole` with `defn`, where its result can borrow from its argument
